    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS offer to the market this two bedroom, two bathroom apartment located in the gated development of Aras na Cluaine, Clondalkin. This popular development in located within easy access to a whole host of amenities including schools, shops, recreational facilities and is within walking distance to Clondalkin Village. Transport wise you have good access to local bus routes, Red Cow Luas and N7/M50 road networks.\n\nInternal living accommodation of c.70 Sq m can be found here and in brief consists of; Entrance hall, storage cupboard, large open plan lounge/dining/kitchen area with front facing balcony, two double bedrooms with master ensuite and a family bathroom. Externally this development offers underground secure parking and communal gardens. Due to recent success in the development we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest!\n\n\nKey Features\n\n<ul>\n <li>TWO BED/ TWO BATH</li>\n <li>3rd Floor apartment</li>\n <li>BER C2</li>\n <li>70 Sqm</li>\n <li>Open Plan living/diner/kitchen</li>\n <li>Superb location</li>\n <li>Balcony to front</li>\n <li>Double bedroom with ensuite</li>\n <li>Secure residential parking</li>\n <li>Gated development</li>\n <li>Close to shops, schools and major road networks</li>\n <li>Viewing is highly advised!</li>\n</ul>\n\nDirections\n\nFrom Clondalkin Village centre, head down Watery Lane, when you reach the T-junction with Woodford Walk, take a right and then an immediate left, you will then find the front gates to the development."
      },
      {
